@baseUrl = http://localhost:5002
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Current Balance (Saldo Atual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consolidado/saldo/atual?accountId={{accountId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Daily Consolidated Report (Relatório Diário - Hoje)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consolidado/diario/2026-05-11?accountId={{accountId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Daily Consolidated Report (Relatório Diário - Ontem)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consolidado/diario/2026-05-10?accountId={{accountId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Notes:
# - The balance endpoint returns cached data (60s TTL)
# - Daily consolidated data is generated by Hangfire job at 23:59 UTC
# - Use docker-compose to run dependencies (PostgreSQL, Redis)
